  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help orphaned baby rhino Little Thaba</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Meet little Thaba, a baby white rhino who was left orphaned in mid-2022 when his mom was shot and killed by poachers for her horn, which was hacked off. Believed to be around 3 months old, he was brought through to the Hoedspruit Endangered Species Centre, where he will be taken care of for quite a few years until he is fully grown and ready to be released into the wild.</narrative>
  </description>
